# Keep the build context small and free of secrets, local state and other platforms' binaries.
.git
.github
.claude
docs
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/coverage
**/*.log

# Secrets: never send local environment files to the Docker daemon.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
